<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Jubail Rugby</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Oswald:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --navy:#06253A;
    --navy-deep:#041826;
    --maroon:#9F291D;
    --maroon-deep:#7A2016;
    --grey:#565B62;
    --grey-deep:#3D4147;
    --grey-light:#D9DBDD;
    --sand:#F3F3F1;
    --ink:#151a22;
    --paper:#fbfaf6;
    --line: rgba(6,37,58,0.12);
    --max: 1120px;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    line-height:1.55;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  h1,h2,h3,.display{
    font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:0.01em;
    margin:0;
  }
  a{color:inherit;}
  img{max-width:100%;display:block;}
  .wrap{max-width:var(--max);margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;}
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    padding:14px 26px;
    font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;
    font-weight:600;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:0.03em;
    font-size:14px;
    border-radius:2px;
    border:1px solid transparent;
    cursor:pointer;
    text-decoration:none;
  }
  .btn-gold{background:var(--grey-light);color:var(--navy-deep);}
  .btn-gold:hover{background:#ffffff;}
  .btn-outline{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);color:#fff;background:transparent;}
  .btn-outline:hover{border-color:#fff;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);}
  .btn-navy{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;}
  .btn-navy:hover{background:var(--navy-deep);}

  /* NAV */
  header{
    position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;
    background:var(--grey);
    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  }
  nav{
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
    padding:16px 24px;max-width:var(--max);margin:0 auto;
  }
  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;}
  .brand-mark{width:42px;height:auto;flex:none;object-fit:contain;}
  .brand-name{display:flex;flex-direction:column;line-height:1.1;}
  .bn-en{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:0.04em;color:#fff;}
  .bn-en em{font-style:normal;color:var(--grey-light);}
  .bn-ar{font-family:'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);direction:rtl;margin-top:1px;}
  .navlinks{display:flex;gap:28px;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;}
  .navlinks a{
    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.78);text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;
    font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.04em;
  }
  .navlinks a:hover{color:#fff;}
  .navcta{display:none;}
  @media(min-width:860px){.navcta{display:inline-flex;}}
  .navlinks{display:none;}
  @media(min-width:860px){.navlinks{display:flex;}}
  .burger{color:#fff;background:none;border:none;font-size:22px;display:block;}
  @media(min-width:860px){.burger{display:none;}}

  /* HERO */
  .hero{
    position:relative;
    background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--navy) 0%, var(--navy-deep) 65%, #4a1620 130%);
    color:#fff;overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero .wrap{
    padding:88px 24px 110px;
    position:relative;z-index:2;
  }
  .hero-sail{
    position:absolute;right:-60px;top:-40px;width:520px;opacity:0.14;
    transform:rotate(6deg);
  }
  .hero-crest{
    position:absolute;right:-40px;bottom:-60px;width:280px;opacity:0.10;
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .foot-logo{width:56px;height:auto;margin-bottom:14px;display:block;}
  .eyebrow-plain{color:var(--grey-light);font-size:14px;font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;letter-spacing:0.04em;margin-bottom:18px;}
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(40px,7vw,78px);
    line-height:0.98;
    max-width:820px;
  }
  .hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--grey-light);}
  .hero p.lead{
    max-width:520px;margin-top:22px;font-size:17px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
  }
  .hero p.lead-ar{
    max-width:520px;margin-top:22px;font-size:17px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
    direction:rtl;font-family:'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;
  }
  .hero p.lead-ar.t-ar{display:none;}
  body.lang-ar .hero p.lead-ar.t-ar{display:block;}
  .hero-actions{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .hero-stats{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:22px;
    margin-top:64px;max-width:640px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);padding-top:28px;
  }
  @media(min-width:640px){.hero-stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);}}
  .stat-num{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(26px,4vw,36px);color:var(--grey-light);}
  .stat-label{font-size:12.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);margin-top:4px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.03em;}

  /* SECTION generic */
  section{padding:80px 0;}
  .section-head{max-width:620px;margin-bottom:46px;}
  .kicker{color:var(--maroon);font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.03em;margin-bottom:10px;}
  .section-head h2{font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,40px);color:var(--navy-deep);}
  .section-head p{margin-top:14px;color:#4a5164;font-size:16px;max-width:540px;}

  /* ABOUT */
  .about{background:var(--paper);}
  .about-grid{display:grid;gap:40px;}
  @media(min-width:880px){.about-grid{grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;align-items:start;}}
  .about-copy p{color:#3c4358;font-size:16px;margin:0 0 16px;}
  .value-list{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:26px 0 0;display:grid;gap:16px;}
  .value-list li{
    display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;padding:16px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .value-num{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;color:var(--maroon);font-size:15px;flex:none;width:26px;}
  .value-list strong{display:block;font-size:15px;color:var(--navy-deep);}
  .value-list span{font-size:14.5px;color:#5a6072;}
  .roadmap-card{
    background:var(--navy);color:#fff;border-radius:2px;padding:32px;
  }
  .roadmap-card h3{color:var(--grey-light);font-size:18px;margin-bottom:20px;}
  .roadmap-item{display:flex;gap:14px;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);}
  .roadmap-item:first-of-type{border-top:none;}
  .roadmap-year{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;color:var(--grey-light);width:52px;flex:none;font-size:14px;}
  .roadmap-item p{margin:0;font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.78);}

  /* STATS BAND */
  .band{background:var(--sand);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .band-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);}
  @media(min-width:720px){.band-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);}}
  .band-cell{background:var(--sand);padding:34px 26px;}
  .band-cell .stat-num{color:var(--maroon);}
  .band-cell .stat-label{color:#5a6072;}

  /* NEWS */
  .news-grid{display:grid;gap:28px;}
  @media(min-width:760px){.news-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);}}
  .news-card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;}
  .news-thumb{
    height:150px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--navy),var(--grey));
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  }
  .news-thumb span{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.03em;}
  .news-body{padding:22px;}
  .news-date{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--maroon);font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;letter-spacing:0.03em;}
  .news-body h3{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;text-transform:none;font-weight:600;font-size:17px;margin-top:8px;color:var(--navy-deep);}
  .news-body p{font-size:14.5px;color:#5a6072;margin-top:8px;}

  /* FIXTURES TABLE */
  .fixtures{background:var(--navy-deep);color:#fff;}
  .fixtures .section-head h2{color:#fff;}
  .fixtures .section-head p{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);}
  .fx-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14.5px;}
  .fx-table th{
    text-align:left;font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.03em;
    font-size:12.5px;color:var(--grey-light);padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
  }
  .fx-table td{padding:14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);}
  .fx-tag{
    display:inline-block;font-size:11.5px;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:20px;
    font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;letter-spacing:0.03em;
  }
  .fx-tag.local{background:rgba(217,219,221,0.25);color:var(--grey-light);}
  .fx-tag.national{background:rgba(86,91,98,0.35);color:#c7cad0;}
  .fx-tag.intl{background:rgba(138,42,55,0.35);color:#e79aa6;}
  .table-scroll{overflow-x:auto;}

  /* PARTNERS */
  .partners{background:var(--sand);}
  .partner-note{
    border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:2px;padding:20px 24px;margin-bottom:36px;
    font-size:14.5px;color:#4a5164;max-width:680px;
  }
  .partner-note strong{color:var(--navy-deep);}
  .partner-tiers{display:grid;gap:24px;}
  @media(min-width:780px){.partner-tiers{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);}}
  .tier-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:28px;border-radius:2px;}
  .tier-card h3{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;text-transform:none;font-weight:600;font-size:17px;color:var(--navy-deep);margin-bottom:10px;}
  .tier-card ul{padding-left:18px;margin:14px 0 0;color:#5a6072;font-size:14px;}
  .tier-card li{margin-bottom:6px;}

  /* JOIN */
  .join{background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--maroon),#5c1a24);color:#fff;}
  .join-grid{display:grid;gap:36px;}
  @media(min-width:880px){.join-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;align-items:center;}}
  .join h2{font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,38px);color:#fff;}
  .join p{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.82);margin-top:14px;font-size:15.5px;max-width:460px;}
  .join-steps{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;gap:14px;}
  .join-steps li{
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.16);
    padding:16px 18px;border-radius:2px;font-size:14.5px;display:flex;gap:12px;
  }
  .join-steps b{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;color:var(--grey-light);flex:none;}

  /* SHOP */
  .shop-grid{display:grid;gap:24px;}
  @media(min-width:640px){.shop-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}}
  @media(min-width:960px){.shop-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);}}
  .product{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:2px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;}
  .product-art{
    height:190px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;
  }
  .product-art svg{width:70px;height:70px;}
  .product-body{padding:20px;}
  .product-body .cat{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--maroon);font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;letter-spacing:0.03em;}
  .product-body h3{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;text-transform:none;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;margin-top:6px;color:var(--navy-deep);}
  .price-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:14px;}
  .price{font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;color:var(--navy-deep);font-size:16px;}
  .soon{font-size:11.5px;color:#8a8f9c;font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.03em;}

  /* CONTACT / FOOTER */
  footer{background:var(--navy-deep);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);padding:60px 0 30px;}
  .foot-grid{display:grid;gap:36px;}
  @media(min-width:780px){.foot-grid{grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr 1fr;}}
  footer h3{color:#fff;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;text-transform:none;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-weight:600;}
  footer a{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);text-decoration:none;font-size:14.5px;}
  footer a:hover{color:var(--grey-light);}
  .foot-links{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;gap:10px;}
  .foot-bottom{
    max-width:var(--max);margin:40px auto 0;padding:22px 24px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;
  }

  /* ===== i18n ===== */
  .t-ar{display:none;}
  body.lang-ar .t-en{display:none;}
  body.lang-ar .t-ar{display:inline;}
  body.lang-ar h1, body.lang-ar h2, body.lang-ar h3,
  body.lang-ar p, body.lang-ar li, body.lang-ar td, body.lang-ar th,
  body.lang-ar .kicker, body.lang-ar .stat-label, body.lang-ar .news-date,
  body.lang-ar .section-head, body.lang-ar .value-list strong, body.lang-ar .value-list span,
  body.lang-ar .roadmap-item p, body.lang-ar .bn-ar, body.lang-ar .price, body.lang-ar .soon,
  body.lang-ar .cat { text-align:right; }
  body.lang-ar .fx-table th, body.lang-ar .fx-table td{text-align:right;}
  body.lang-ar .value-list li, body.lang-ar .roadmap-item, body.lang-ar .join-steps li{flex-direction:row-reverse;}
  .lang-switch{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
    border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;margin-left:16px;flex:none;
  }
  .lang-switch button{
    background:none;border:none;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;
    font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.03em;padding:6px 14px;cursor:pointer;
  }
  .lang-switch button.active{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.16);color:#fff;}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <nav>
    <a href="#top" class="brand">
      <img class="brand-mark" src="{{ settings.logo }}" alt="Jubail Rugby crest">
      <span class="brand-name">
        <span class="bn-en">JUBAIL <em>RUGBY</em></span>
        <span class="bn-ar">الجبيل للرقبي</span>
      </span>
    </a>
    <ul class="navlinks">
      <li><a href="#about"><span class="t-en">About</span><span class="t-ar" dir="rtl">من نحن</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="#news"><span class="t-en">News</span><span class="t-ar" dir="rtl">الأخبار</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="#fixtures"><span class="t-en">Fixtures</span><span class="t-ar" dir="rtl">المباريات</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="#partners"><span class="t-en">Partners</span><span class="t-ar" dir="rtl">الشراكات</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="#shop"><span class="t-en">Shop</span><span class="t-ar" dir="rtl">المتجر</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact"><span class="t-en">Contact</span><span class="t-ar" dir="rtl">تواصل</span></a></li>
    </ul>
    <a href="#join" class="btn btn-gold navcta"><span class="t-en">Join the Team</span><span class="t-ar" dir="rtl">انضم للفريق</span></a>
    <div class="lang-switch" role="group" aria-label="Language">
      <button type="button" data-lang-btn="en" class="active">EN</button>
      <button type="button" data-lang-btn="ar">عربي</button>
    </div>
    <button class="burger" aria-label="menu">☰</button>
  </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero" id="top">
  <svg class="hero-sail" viewBox="0 0 200 200" fill="none">
    <path d="M60 170 L100 30 L140 170 Z" stroke="#D9DBDD" stroke-width="1.5"/>
  </svg>
  <img class="hero-crest" src="{{ settings.logo }}" alt="">

  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow-plain"><span class="t-en">Jubail Industrial City · Est. 2024</span><span class="t-ar" dir="rtl">مدينة الجبيل الصناعية · تأسس 2024</span></div>
    <h1><span class="t-en">{{ settings.hero_heading_en | safe }}</span><span class="t-ar" dir="rtl">{{ settings.hero_heading_ar | safe }}</span></h1>
    <p class="lead t-en">{{ settings.hero_sub_en }}</p><p class="lead-ar t-ar" dir="rtl">{{ settings.hero_sub_ar }}</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#join" class="btn btn-gold"><span class="t-en">Join the Team</span><span class="t-ar" dir="rtl">انضم للفريق</span></a>
      <a href="#partners" class="btn btn-outline"><span class="t-en">Partner With Us</span><span class="t-ar" dir="rtl">كن شريكاً</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stats">
      <div><div class="stat-num">30+</div><div class="stat-label"><span class="t-en">Active Players</span><span class="t-ar" dir="rtl">لاعب نشط</span></div></div>
      <div><div class="stat-num">6</div><div class="stat-label"><span class="t-en">Capped for Saudi National Team</span><span class="t-ar" dir="rtl">مثّلوا المنتخب السعودي</span></div></div>
      <div><div class="stat-num">3rd</div><div class="stat-label"><span class="t-en">Place, Saudi League 24–25</span><span class="t-ar" dir="rtl">المركز، الدوري السعودي ٢٤–٢٥</span></div></div>
      <div><div class="stat-num">90%</div><div class="stat-label"><span class="t-en">Saudi National Players</span><span class="t-ar" dir="rtl">لاعبون سعوديون</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="wrap about-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom:30px;">
        <div class="kicker"><span class="t-en">Who We Are</span><span class="t-ar" dir="rtl">من نحن</span></div>
        <h2><span class="t-en">A team built by players, for the community</span><span class="t-ar" dir="rtl">فريق بناه اللاعبون، من أجل المجتمع</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="about-copy">
        <p class="t-en">Jubail Rugby was founded in 2024 as an initiative by a small group of dedicated players and passionate individuals, in step with the Royal Commission for Jubail &amp; Yanbu's vision of "Industry and Life." What started with a handful of teammates training together has grown into a full squad open to every part of Jubail society.</p>
        <p class="t-en">We're a community team first: men and women, beginners and elite players, all training toward the same goal — making rugby a lasting part of Jubail's sporting culture.</p>
        <p class="t-ar" dir="rtl">تأسس فريق الجبيل للرقبي عام 2024 كمبادرة من مجموعة صغيرة من اللاعبين المتحمسين، تماشياً مع رؤية الهيئة الملكية للجبيل وينبع "الصناعة والحياة". ما بدأ بعدد قليل من الزملاء يتدربون معاً تحوّل إلى فريق كامل مفتوح لكل فئات مجتمع الجبيل.</p>
        <p class="t-ar" dir="rtl">نحن فريق مجتمعي في المقام الأول: رجال ونساء، مبتدئون ومحترفون، جميعهم يتدربون نحو هدف واحد — جعل الرقبي جزءاً دائماً من ثقافة الجبيل الرياضية.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="value-list">
        <li><span class="value-num">01</span><div><strong><span class="t-en">Training, three days a week</span><span class="t-ar" dir="rtl">تدريب ثلاث أيام أسبوعياً</span></strong><span><span class="t-en">Regular sessions and open tryouts every Friday at Deffi Park.</span><span class="t-ar" dir="rtl">تمارين منتظمة وتجارب مفتوحة كل جمعة في منتزه الدفي.</span></span></div></li>
        <li><span class="value-num">02</span><div><strong><span class="t-en">Compete locally and abroad</span><span class="t-ar" dir="rtl">المنافسة محلياً ودولياً</span></strong><span><span class="t-en">Saudi 7s &amp; 15s leagues, Touch Rugby, and friendly fixtures in Bahrain, Dubai and Doha.</span><span class="t-ar" dir="rtl">دوريات السبعات والخمسة عشر السعودية، تتش رقبي، ومباريات ودية في البحرين ودبي والدوحة.</span></span></div></li>
        <li><span class="value-num">03</span><div><strong><span class="t-en">A pathway to the national team</span><span class="t-ar" dir="rtl">طريق نحو المنتخب الوطني</span></strong><span><span class="t-en">Six of our players have already represented Saudi Arabia internationally.</span><span class="t-ar" dir="rtl">ستة من لاعبينا مثّلوا السعودية دولياً بالفعل.</span></span></div></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="roadmap-card">
